    s__COMIC_FOR_A_GROWN_UP(py_str("*Saga* by Brian K. Vaughan is the usual first pick for an adult: a space story with a family at its centre and art that carries the plot. *Watchmen* if you want the one that changed what comics could do, *Persepolis* by Marjane Satrapi for a memoir told this way, and *Heartstopper* by Alice Oseman for a warm school romance. For manga, *Death Note* or *One Piece* is where most people start. Begin with a complete story rather than a forty-year superhero run, and a library will lend all of these."));
