    s__COMIC_MANGA(py_str("*Death Note* (a notebook that kills, and the duel that follows) is the usual first manga: twelve volumes, a clean ending, and nothing to know beforehand. *One Piece* if they want a long one to live in, or *Fullmetal Alchemist* if they would rather have something they can finish. Read right to left, back to front - the pages are printed the Japanese way."));
